  (text "COMPONENT LIST (Revision 11):" (at 15.0 225.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "ICs\nU1  STM32G051K6U6  QFN-32    MCU (dual DAC, libopencm3, FW Rev 11)\nU2  AMS1117-3.3 / MCP1700  SOT-223/23  LDO 12-16V -> 3.3V (see 7A.6)\nU4  MCP1700-5002   SOT-23   LDO 12-16V -> 5V rail (GD2 brake buffer only; GD1 on WHITE)\nGD2 op-amp buffer  SOT-23-5  Brake gate buffer (DAC1 -> Q2, linear)\nGD1 HV op-amp     SOT-23-5  Anti-brake CURRENT-SOURCE loop on WHITE rail (PWM demand -> Q1; Rsense 0.1ohm)\nU5  INA210         SC70-6   Ideal-diode current-sense amp (gain 200, +5V) across Rsns_sw.\nU6  LM311          SOT23-5  Ideal-diode comparator (~50mV hyst, ~0.16A trip) -> Q5/Q6 gate driver + PA6 brake-detect.\n    (replaces LTC7001+INA241+comparator; TI vs ADI; adds protection)\nU3  CH340N         SOP-8    USB-UART bridge" (at 15.0 229.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "FETs / power devices\nQ2  TW100N03CC D2PAK  Low-Rds logic-level N-ch brake FET (~3mohm 30V); IRFP250N=brushed-only alt\nQ1  TIP147     TO-220  PNP Darlington anti-brake current-source pass (100V 10A 125W) + HEATSINK\n   (alt: N-MOSFET SUP70060E / RFP50N06 / FDP61N20)\nRsense 0.1ohm 1-2W  anti-brake current sense (0.3V at 3A)\nR_KA1 6.8k/R_KA2 1.2k  DAC2 anti-brake divider   GD3 LM7321  DAC2->WHITE level translator\nQ5  STL059N4S8AG PowerFLAT  Reverse-block N-ch (40V 0.59mohm)\nQ6  STL059N4S8AG PowerFLAT  Reverse-block N-ch (common-source with Q5)\n   (alt Q5/Q6: Vishay SiJK140E 0.34mohm)\nDiodes\nD1  P6KE18CA  SMB  TVS bidirectional (WHITE rail clamp; CA essential)\nD2  SS310     SMB  Q2 catch diode (100V)\nD4  MBRS360   SMB  Anti-brake follower reverse block (emitter -> track)\nRsns_sw ~1mohm  ideal-diode shunt (INA210 senses across)\nR_THR1/R_THR2/R_HYS/R_CMP  LM311 threshold divider, ~50mV hysteresis, OC pull-up\nD5  LED Red   0805  Status LED (PB6)" (at 95.0 229.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "Passives\nF1  500mA-1A polyfuse 1812  WHITE rail MCU/analog supply ONLY (never BLACK)\nR2  10k 0402  GD2 input safe-default pull-up\nR3  10R 0402  Q2 gate    R_BASE 1k 0402  Q1 Darlington base\nRsense 0.1ohm  anti-brake current sense   Rsns_sw ~1mohm  ideal-diode shunt\nR_KA1 6.8k/R_KA2 1.2k  DAC2 anti-brake divider (feeds GD3 LM7321 translator)\nR8  15k / R9 4k7  WHITE sense divider (PA0)\nR10 22k / R11 4k7 BLACK sense divider (PA1, track side of switch)\nR5  10k  Pot ref to 3.3V    R12 330R  Status LED\nC1-C7 decoupling (LDO rails + MCU VDD/VDDA)" (at 175.0 229.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "Connectors\nJ1-J6  4mm banana  Track + controller WHITE/BLACK/RED (x2 sides)\nJ7  3-pin 2.54mm  Mode toggle A/B/C (PB0/PB1/GND)\nJ10 4-pin SWD  J11 3-pin UART  J12 BOOT0  J13 NRST\nJ14 4-pin TM1637 display (CLK/DIO/GND/VCC)\nNOTE: J9 capture button REMOVED (toggle replaces it; PB3 reserved/optional)" (at 15.0 262.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "KEY DESIGN NOTES (Rev 11):" (at 115.0 262.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "- Reverse-block pass element = two N-ch (Q5/Q6, common-source) + INA210/LM311 ideal diode\n  INA210 (gain 200, +5V) across Rsns_sw; LM311 (~50mV hyst) trips on reverse (~0.16A, ~2us)\n  -> gate driver off + PA6 brake-detect. No I2t/SCP/IMON (open items); gate-drive charge pump\n  from WHITE to lift gates above BLACK (open item). Sits in BLACK CONTROLLER path. ~87mV at 40A.\n- BLACK sense (PA1) is on the TRACK side of the pass switch.\n- D1 TVS is on the WHITE rail only (transient clamp).\n- Anti-brake = constant-CURRENT source (Q1 TIP147 + GD1 HV op-amp + Rsense 0.1ohm). GD1 is\n  powered from the WHITE rail (~16V), NOT +5V (it senses at ~16V common mode). DAC2\n  demand (R_KA1/R_KA2 divider + GD3 LM7321) sets current: 0 = off, full = 3A. Bounded at stall.\n- Brake (Q2 TW100N03CC) is resistance-controlled, linear, no PWM. Both Q1 and Q2\n  dissipate 10-15W linear and REQUIRE heatsinks.\n- PA4 DAC1 = brake (linear). PA5 DAC2 = anti-brake current demand (direct DC, no PWM).\n- Retired & must NOT be fitted: TIM3 PWM, UCC27524 drivers, IRF9Z34N P-ch +\n  floating supply (ZD1/R_Z1/C_Z1/LM321), IRLB3034, LTC4412 pass gate, capture button,\n  LTC7001/INA241/comparator (now INA210/LM311 ideal diode), TIP122 voltage follower (now TIP147 current source); 2N2222 KA level-shift + C_KA RC filter (now DAC2+GD3); PB4 voltmeter PWM/RC (now TM1637 display)." (at 115.0 266.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
)
